@strong{Burnish} is an Elisp package that automates the export and viewing of an Org file (@ref{Top,,,org,}). With @strong{Burnish}@comma{} users can rapidly iterate and review changes to an Org file.

If you enjoy using @strong{Burnish}@comma{} please consider buying me a coffee to help support its development and maintenance.

