@node Features
@chapter Features

@cindex Features

@itemize
@item
Automated export and view support for the following Org backends (@ref{Exporting,,,org,}):

@itemize
@item
HTML
@item
Markdown
@item
ODT
@item
Texinfo/Info
@item
@LaTeX{} PDF
@end itemize

@item
Trigger export and view via @code{save-buffer} or by a customizable key binding (default @kbd{C-<f5>}).

@item
Support for additional export backends.

@strong{Burnish} provides a high-degree of customization to support different export and view behaviors for both built-in and user-added backends.

@item
File-level control of running @strong{Burnish}.

Only automate export and view on the files you specify.
@end itemize

